shadowfetch-ai-workspace (2.1.2-1) umbra; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Shadowfetch Linux 2.1.2 "Fire Edition".
  * shadowfetch-workspace-create: one command to a private agent workspace.
  * shadowfetch-llama@.service (user): per-workspace llama-server, localhost
    only, --metrics for Firewatch tokens/sec, MemoryHigh guard.
  * shadowfetch-llama-announce: runtime announce files consumed by Firewatch.

